flowchart LR
  ACTOR[User, device, or agent] --> REQUEST[Domain command]
  REQUEST --> AUTH[Permission evaluator]
  POLICY[(Roles and grants)] --> AUTH
  AUTH -->|allow| VALIDATE[Domain validation]
  AUTH -->|deny| ERROR[Visible denial]
  VALIDATE --> TX[Atomic transaction]
  TX --> AUDIT[(Redacted audit record)]
  TX --> STATE[(Local state)]
